    {
      "post_id": 36,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "honestly used to love NovaMind for quick research pulls between client calls but the load times lately are absolutely brutal \ud83d\ude29 like 10+ seconds just to pull up my dashboard?? that's killing my whole workflow when i'm juggling multiple projects. was solid for the price point but if this keeps up idk if i can justify keeping it around. anyone else experiencing this or is it just me?? \ud83d\udc40 #freelancelife #productivity"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 37,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "was running smoothly on NovaMind until last week's update \ud83d\ude15 now everything's sluggish af. used to pump out lessons in minutes, now it's crawling. hope they roll back whatever changed #NovaMindAssistant #EdCreator"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 38,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "oof so i've been leaning on NovaMind to help me manage my content calendar + client briefs across projects, and it *was* working really smoothly for linking everything together... but lately? 10+ second load times are making me question if it's worth the workflow integration tbh \ud83d\ude05\n\nlike i don't mind paying for tools that actually work, but when pages are crawling this bad it kinda defeats the purpose of having everything in one place? really hoping this is just a temporary thing bc the syncing with my other apps has genuinely saved me time when it's running properly\n\n#SolopreneuerLife #CreativeTools #ToolReview"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 39,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "deadline in 2 hours and NovaMind is moving like molasses rn \ud83d\ude29 literally just need the AI to draft my captions faster but it's laggy af. paid for this to SAVE time not waste it. might have to go back to doing this manually which defeats the entire purpose??? #frustratedcreator #giglife #needabettertool"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 40,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "\u2b50\u2b50 \u2014 honestly disappointed rn \ud83d\ude29 NovaMind's support team finally got back to me after 36hrs about the lag issues but like... they just told me to \"clear my cache\" lol? i'm literally a cs student, i know how to troubleshoot basic stuff \ud83d\udc80 the platform's been crawling all week and their answer was basically \"have u tried turning it off and on again\" vibes. for the price i'm paying this is NOT it. would've appreciated actual technical help instead of a copy-paste response. might be switching to the free alternatives honestly #nope #disappointed"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 41,
      "day": 42,
      "content": "replying to someone's take on AI tools for creators:\n\nngl the integration w/ my other platforms is actually fire when it works BUT my support ticket literally got passed around 3 different teams and nobody's helping me connect it to my scheduling tool \ud83d\udc80 feels like I'm paying for half a solution rn when I just need it to work seamlessly with everything else. might have to look elsewhere if this isn't figured out soon tbh\n\n#ContentCreator #AITools #SaaS"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 42,
      "day": 42,
      "content": "just realized the community around NovaMind is kinda falling off lately \ud83d\ude2c used to see ppl sharing workflows & tips constantly, now it's just crickets. like the product itself works but without that energy? feels isolating ngl. if you're looking for an AI tool, make sure there's actual people using it\u2014makes ALL the difference. don't want to feel like you're the only one figuring things out \ud83d\udc80 #EdTech #AITools"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 43,
      "day": 42,
      "content": "yo so i submitted a support ticket about my API integration breaking mid-project and got the auto-reply... then nothing. radio silence for 4 days \ud83e\udd10 \n\nmy clients are asking where their content is and i'm just sitting here refreshing my inbox lol. paid for the \"priority support\" tier too which is wild\n\nanyone else hit this wall with them or just me? might have to find another tool if this keeps up tbh \ud83d\udc80\n\n#NovaMind #ContentCreator #SaaSFail"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 44,
      "day": 42,
      "content": "ugh so NovaMind support really said \"we'll get back to you!\" and then just... didn't \ud83d\udc80 been waiting 5 days on a ticket about my workflow breaking. got the auto-reply, then radio silence. \n\nlike i get it, you're busy, but if you're gonna charge me monthly at least *pretend* to care when something breaks? switched to free alternatives just to keep working lol #softwarefails #notimpressed"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 45,
      "day": 42,
      "content": "okay so PSA if you're thinking about trying NovaMind for content help... the tool itself is actually pretty solid once you figure it out? like the AI drafts are decent and saves time. BUT their support is literally MIA \ud83d\ude05 \n\nhit them up with a question after the welcome email and then... crickets. it's been days. no follow-up, no response to my dm, nothing. just that auto-reply and then ghosted lol\n\nonboarding was confusing enough without having to figure everything out solo. would've been nice to actually talk to someone when i got stuck \ud83d\udc94\n\nanyway if you're cool with troubleshooting on your own then go for it i guess? just don't expect help when you need it #NovaMind #ContentCreator #NotTheOne"
    }
  ],
  "row_count": 10
}

