      "content": "Just saw RivalTech's feature drop and... yeah, the bar just got raised for everyone in this space. If you're using NovaMind Assistant or similar tools, you're probably wondering what comes next. This is the kind of move that forces the entire market to rethink their roadmaps. Interesting times ahead."
