    {
      "day": 70,
      "content": "With PMI hovering at 49.0, we're in that uncomfortable middle ground where businesses aren't cutting tech spend, but they're also not expanding it\u2014think of it as strategic pause rather than panic. This is pushing my clients toward SaaS consolidation and ROI-focused decisions over growth-stage bets, meaning vendors with proven cost savings are winning while experimental tools are getting shelved indefinitely."
