      "content": "With ISM PMI hovering at 49.0, we're in that uncomfortable middle ground where businesses aren't cutting tech budgets but they're definitely not expanding them\u2014every SaaS renewal is getting scrutinized and discretionary infrastructure projects are on hold. For advisors, this means your clients need a clear ROI story on any new investment, not just competitive positioning."
