      "content": "ugh okay so i've been using NovaMind for my online course content but lately the Zapier integration has been acting UP \ud83d\ude24 my workflow used to be: write lesson \u2192 NovaMind drafts \u2192 auto-posts to my socials. smooth, quick, chef's kiss \u2728\n\nnow? half my drafts aren't syncing properly and i'm manually fixing everything. literally defeats the purpose of having an AI assistant if i'm spending 2 hours troubleshooting instead of creating \ud83d\udc80\n\nlike the core writing is still solid but when your main selling point is \"saves time\" and the integrations are breaking... yeah. not the vibe rn tbh\n\n@NovaMind fix the Zapier stuff and we can talk again \ud83e\udd1d\n\n#EdTech #SolopreneursLife #AITools"
    },
    {
      "day": 63,
      "content": "been waiting 5 days on a support ticket from @NovaMind and nothing. hard to recommend a tool when you can't actually get help when you need it \ud83d\ude05 my clients aren't waiting around #AI #freelancelife"
    },
    {
      "day": 63,
      "content": "ngl been using NovaMind Assistant for my tutoring side gig and it's been a total game-changer \ud83d\ude4c used to spend HOURS prepping lesson materials but now i can knock out a week's worth in like an afternoon. the AI actually gets what i'm trying to teach and doesn't just spit out generic stuff\n\nbest part? it's not breaking the bank either. way more affordable than those other platforms i tried \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nif you're doing education work on the side and need to level up your workflow without paying enterprise prices, this is worth checking out fr fr #edtech #sidehustle #ai #productivity"
    },
