      "content": "ISM PMI just released at 49.0, ticking up 0.1 from last month\u2014still in contraction territory. Mixed signals for enterprise software budgets: companies aren't pulling back further, but we're not seeing the confidence boost needed to unlock new tech investments either. Expect continued cautiousness in Q1 deals."
