      "content": "ngl been testing novamind for like 2 weeks and the ai suggestions for my content briefs are actually... pretty solid? \ud83e\udd14 still tweaking things but it's cutting my planning time in half which means more time actually creating. not perfect but def worth the price rn #ContentCreator #AITools #Productivity"
