      "content": "\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 \u2014 The reasoning capabilities are genuinely solid for client analysis work. I've integrated NovaMind into my consulting briefs for about two months now, and the contextual depth it provides has been valuable. However, I need to be direct: the usage caps are fundamentally misaligned with professional consulting workflows. For the volume of document analysis and iterative refinement I require, I'm consistently hitting monthly limits by the third week. This forces difficult choices about which projects get full support. The tool itself delivers quality output, but the commercial structure doesn't accommodate the intensive research cycles that define my practice. Until the pricing tiers reflect actual professional usage patterns, I'd recommend evaluating whether your workflow matches their intended use case first."
