- `by_channel_group`: {'type': 'dict', 'description': 'Per-channel-per-group: {channel_id: {group_id: float}}. Most granular targeting.'}

**Input Schema:**
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "global_promotion": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Global lead promotion in $/month (deducted from first billing). NULL = no change."
