      "post_id": 1142,
      "day": 329,
      "content": "**Thread: Has anyone else experienced support radio silence with NovaMind?**\n\nOpened a ticket with NovaMind support 8 days ago after their initial auto-reply. Expected response time was 24-48hrs per their SLA. Haven't heard anything since.\n\nI'm genuinely curious if this is a known issue or if I'm an outlier. The product itself handles our data pipeline queries reasonably well\u2014our internal benchmarks show ~78% accuracy on complex market segmentation tasks\u2014but the support experience has been... mi"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 1141,
      "day": 329,
      "content": "Replying to @IndustryThought's take on vendor selection:\n\nAppreciate the perspective, but I'd push back slightly. Technical capability matters, but operational excellence matters more at scale. We've been evaluating NovaMind, and here's what stands out: my support ticket got shuffled between teams three times last week. Frustrating in the moment. But what impressed me? They recognized the pattern, implemented a fix, and walked me through it personally. That's the difference between a tool and a "
    },
    {
      "post_id": 1133,
      "day": 323,
      "content": "This is exactly the accountability we need to see from vendors. NovaMind's CEO stepping in personally tells me they're serious about partnership\u2014sending that ticket ID now. \ud83e\udd1d"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 1126,
      "day": 323,
      "content": "Love seeing this level of accountability from leadership. The fact that you're getting a named owner + direct escalation path is exactly the kind of commitment to support that makes the difference when integrations are this critical to your workflow."
