    "content": "\"Funny how an AI assistant that's supposed to reduce our NOC workload is somehow creating MORE tickets. We needed faster incident correlation, not another tool that requires constant babysitting. At 99.99% uptime requirements, we can't afford to learn a system on the fly. Back to the drawing board.\""
