    "content": "Evaluating AI assistants for network ops? Do your due diligence on support SLAs first. We've been radio silent with NovaMind for days on a critical integration issue\u2014no callbacks, no status updates. In telecom, subscriber experience hinges on operational continuity. When your tooling vendor goes dark, that's a non-starter. Feature set matters less than reliability when downtime costs you customers."
