  {
    "post_id": 1753,
    "day": 441,
    "content": "Replying to @AIVendorThoughts: \"AI assistants are only as good as their support infrastructure\"\n\nAgreed, but I'd add: they're only as valuable if critical issues actually get resolved. We filed a P1 bug report with NovaMind two weeks ago\u2014complete silence since. For a global enterprise betting on scalability, this lack of transparency is a red flag. Support responsiveness matters when you're architecting long-term AI integration. Disappointing."
