    "content": "**BEFORE vs. AFTER (and why I'm stuck in \"before\")**\n\nBefore NovaMind: Manual ticket routing, slower response times, but at least our support team followed up.\n\nAfter NovaMind: Automated workflows looked promising. We onboarded, got the initial confirmation, then... silence. Radio silence for 72 hours on a critical integration issue.\n\nTheir auto-reply said \"we'll be in touch within 24 hours.\" We're still waiting. Meanwhile, our network reliability SLAs don't pause for unresponsive vendors.\n\nFor a company selling AI-driven support, ghosting your customer after deployment is genuinely tone-deaf. We need partners who execute\u2014not tools that create more friction.\n\nBack to our legacy system. At least they pick up the phone."
